# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (see com.redwood.demo.plist). RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.swprof: the home-screen swipe profile (docs/swipe-profile.md).
# passbench=1: tools/pass_bench (src/pass_bench.c): what one render pass costs by load/store setting; ends at once without the argument.
/redwood/bin/pass_bench ifarg passbench= &
# swprof=1: unlock, then 40 home-screen page swipes both ways (about 24 s from log s 145; bb_prof=115 bb_prof_all=1 samples the render thread for 10 s of it)
/redwood/bin/rwtouch ifarg swprof=1 say start wait 120 tap 0.5 0.06 wait 1 notify com.redwood.unlock wait 5 say swprof swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.85 0.45 0.15 0.45 250 wait 0.35 swipe 0.15 0.45 0.85 0.45 250 wait 0.35 say end wait 40
